Cheatsheet.
  ./blogit.pl 
This creates updated blog.xml.
Now recreate index.html 
  perl  index.htm "Rodent Applications: xffm4" > new.html
Check new.html
cp new.html to index.html

sftp to web.sourceforge.net
cd htdocs
upload index.html

///////////////////////////
To update your SourceForge project homepage, 
you upload your custom HTML/CSS/JS files 
via SFTP (using clients like FileZilla 
or command line) to the 
/home/project-web/<projectname>/htdocs/ 
directory on web.sourceforge.net.

Once logged in with ftp, just cd htdocs to
get into /home/project-web/<projectname>/htdocs/
